// Natural Loop Discovery, Irreducible Cycle Detection, Canonical Loop Simplification & LCSSA
// (`opt_loop_simplify`), MemorySSA/AliasInfo/EffectInfo Loop-Carried Dependence & Invariance Queries,
// and Overflow-Faithful Scalar Evolution (`SCEV`) Engine (T610 / E15.3).
// Implements SPEC-72 §1 & §3 (AXS-LOOP-001..006, AXS-LOOP-010..011, AXS-LOOP-017,
// REQ-OPT-143..147, REQ-OPT-155..158, REQ-OPT-189, REQ-OPT-190).
